  "historyNote": "#6901, eff 12-4-98; ss by #8810, INTERIM, eff 1-25-07, EXPIRED: 7-25-07 New. #9032, eff 11-21-07; ss by #10053, eff 1-1-12 (from Ac 101.07); renumbered by #13995 (formerly Ac 102.07)",
